---
import BlockLayout from '../../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import KeyPanel from '../../../components/chain/KeyPanel.astro';
import { DEVNET, assertDevnetLaunchPinned } from '../../../data/chain-home';
import '../../../styles/chain-apps.css';
assertDevnetLaunchPinned();
---
<BlockLayout title="Signal Run · a daily PointCast chain game" description="Find three signals, reach the gate, and collect a daily event stamp. A playable route puzzle with optional signed participation receipts on the PointCast devnet." themeColor="#101427" immersive hideAds>
  <main class="signal-run chn" data-signal-run data-api={DEVNET.url} data-genesis={DEVNET.genesis} data-chain-id={DEVNET.chainId}>
    <nav class="sr-nav" aria-label="Game navigation"><a href="/chain/">← PointCast chain</a><span>DAILY FIELD GAME / 001</span><a href="#passport">Your passport ↗</a></nav>
    <header class="sr-hero"><div><p class="sr-kicker">A LITTLE EXPEDITION. A RECORD YOU CAN KEEP.</p><h1>Signal<span>Run.</span><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i></h1><p class="sr-lede">Three signals. One way home.<br />Make your moves count.</p></div><div class="sr-event"><span>LIVE DAILY EVENT</span><strong data-event-day>Today, UTC</strong><small>3 stages · a new event each UTC day</small><span class="sr-pill">FREE TO PLAY · NO WALLET NEEDED</span></div></header>
    <section class="sr-play" aria-labelledby="game-heading">
      <div class="sr-board-wrap"><div class="sr-board-top"><h2 id="game-heading" data-stage-title>01 / The arrival</h2><span data-stage-count>STAGE 1 / 3</span></div>
        <div class="sr-meters"><div><small>SIGNALS</small><strong data-shards>0 / 3</strong></div><div><small>MOVES LEFT</small><strong data-energy>—</strong></div><div><small>EVENT</small><strong data-event-progress>0 / 3</strong></div></div>
        <div class="sr-board" data-board role="group" aria-label="Signal route board. Use arrow keys or the direction buttons." tabindex="0"></div>
        <div class="sr-legend"><span><b class="sr-dot sr-dot-player">◆</b> You</span><span><b class="sr-dot sr-dot-shard">✳</b> Signal</span><span><b class="sr-dot sr-dot-exit">↗</b> Gate</span><span><b class="sr-dot sr-dot-wall">▧</b> Wall</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sr-console"><p class="sr-kicker">THE MISSION</p><h2>Find the signal.<br />Bring it home.</h2><p>Pick up all three <b>✳ signals</b>, then reach the <b>↗ gate</b> before your moves run out. Walls block your path. Every step counts.</p><p class="sr-help">Arrow keys / WASD, swipe the board, tap a neighboring square, or use the controls below.</p>
        <div class="sr-dpad" aria-label="Movement controls"><button type="button" data-dir="U" aria-label="Move up">↑</button><button type="button" data-dir="L" aria-label="Move left">←</button><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span><button type="button" data-dir="R" aria-label="Move right">→</button><button type="button" data-dir="D" aria-label="Move down">↓</button></div>
        <p class="sr-live" data-game-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading your expedition…</p>
        <div class="sr-game-actions"><button type="button" class="sr-primary" data-next hidden>Next stage →</button><button type="button" data-retry>Restart stage</button><button type="button" data-hint>Show next step</button></div>
        <p class="sr-fine">Hints are welcome. Your event stamp records if you used them. Replay as often as you like. This expedition keeps the date shown; reload for the next UTC event.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sr-passport" id="passport" aria-labelledby="passport-title"><div class="sr-section-head"><div><p class="sr-kicker">SMALL ADVENTURES, COLLECTED</p><h2 id="passport-title">Your event passport.</h2></div><span data-passport-count>0 daily stamps</span></div><p>Finish all three stages to collect today’s illustrated stamp in this browser. Keep up to 14 daily stamps here, and download any stamp as a picture.</p><div data-passport class="sr-stamps"></div><p class="sr-fine" data-storage-status>Browser stamps are local souvenirs, not tokens. Clearing browser data removes this collection. A downloaded picture does not prove chain inclusion.</p></section>
    <section class="sr-chain" aria-labelledby="receipt-title"><div class="sr-section-head"><div><p class="sr-kicker">OPTIONAL / WRITE YOUR EVENT INTO A BLOCK</p><h2 id="receipt-title">Give your run a receipt.</h2></div><span class="sr-pill">POINTCAST DEVNET</span></div><p>A completed run can become a public <b>signed participation post</b> on channel <code>SIGNALRUN</code>. Your wallet address, event date, routes, moves and hints become public. The game runs in your browser; the chain records your claim and does not independently validate your score.</p><p class="sr-fine">One server runs this resettable devnet. It has no promised value and is not anchored to another chain. These receipts are not NFTs, prizes or ownership certificates. Posting costs no play ATTN. Never use a real wallet seed here.</p>
      <details class="sr-wallet"><summary>Set up a devnet play key & review today’s receipt</summary><p class="sr-fine">This uses the same optional browser play key as the Notary and Daily Mint. A passkey wallet from Start here is a separate account.</p><KeyPanel signs="your Signal Run event receipt" id="signal-run-key" /><p data-chain-status role="status" aria-live="polite">No transaction has been prepared.</p><button type="button" class="sr-primary" data-review disabled>Review today’s receipt</button></details>
      <div class="sr-review" data-review-panel hidden><h3>Review before signing</h3><p>Nothing has been signed or uploaded. Signing publishes the body below. This cannot be undone while this devnet exists.</p><p><b>Network:</b> <code data-review-network></code></p><p><b>Signing account:</b> <code data-review-account></code></p><p><b>Public event body:</b></p><pre data-review-body></pre><details><summary>Exact transaction fields and signing digest</summary><pre data-review-fields></pre></details><p><button type="button" class="sr-primary" data-sign>Sign and publish this receipt</button> <button type="button" data-cancel>Cancel</button></p></div>
      <div class="sr-receipt" data-receipt-panel hidden><h3 data-receipt-title>Receipt pending</h3><p data-receipt-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><code data-receipt-hash></code><p class="sr-game-actions"><button type="button" data-check>Check chain inclusion</button><button type="button" data-download-receipt>Download receipt JSON</button><a data-verify href="/chain/verify-a-block" hidden>Verify the block ↗</a></p></div>
    </section>
    <footer class="sr-footer"><span>POINTCAST / SIGNAL RUN</span><a href="/chain/start/">Explore the devnet →</a><a href="/chain/verify-a-block/">How a block is checked →</a></footer>
    <noscript><p>Signal Run needs JavaScript to play. Nothing is signed without your review.</p></noscript>
  </main>
</BlockLayout>
<script is:inline type="module">
  import { mount } from '/chain/apps/signal-run-view.js';
  const start = () => { const root = document.querySelector('[data-signal-run]'); if (root && !root.dataset.mounted) { root.dataset.mounted = 'yes'; mount(root); } };
  start(); document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', start);
</script>
<style is:global>
  body:has(.signal-run){background:#101427}
  .signal-run{--sr-bg:#101427;--sr-panel:#191e35;--sr-line:#343b59;--sr-text:#f5f3ff;--sr-dim:#b1b6ce;--sr-lime:#dcff79;--sr-violet:#b2a0ff;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 28px 90px;background:var(--sr-bg);color:var(--sr-text);font-family:var(--pc-font-sans,Arial,sans-serif);color-scheme:dark}.signal-run *{box-sizing:border-box}.signal-run a{color:inherit}.signal-run button,.signal-run summary{cursor:pointer}.signal-run button{min-height:46px;border:1px solid var(--sr-line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;background:#252b45;color:var(--sr-text);font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;touch-action:manipulation}.signal-run button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}.signal-run :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--sr-lime);outline-offset:4px}.signal-run [hidden]{display:none!important}.signal-run .sr-primary{background:var(--sr-lime);color:#18211a;border-color:var(--sr-lime)}.sr-nav,.sr-section-head,.sr-board-top,.sr-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}.sr-nav{font:11px/1.5 monospace;color:var(--sr-dim);padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sr-line)}.sr-nav a{text-decoration:none}.sr-hero{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding:50px 0 42px}.sr-kicker{font:10px/1.6 monospace;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--sr-violet);margin:0 0 18px}.sr-hero h1{font-size:clamp(68px,10vw,130px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.085em;margin:0;font-weight:800}.sr-hero h1 span{color:var(--sr-lime)}.sr-hero h1 i{color:var(--sr-violet);font-style:normal;font-size:.65em;margin-left:18px}.sr-lede{font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--sr-dim);margin:22px 0 0}.sr-event{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-left:1px solid var(--sr-line);padding-left:28px;font:11px/1.6 monospace;color:var(--sr-dim)}.sr-event strong{font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--sr-text)}.sr-pill{display:inline-block;font:10px/1.5 monospace;letter-spacing:.05em;border:1px solid var(--sr-line);padding:7px 10px;border-radius:50px;width:fit-content;color:var(--sr-lime)}.sr-play{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(260px,.8fr);background:var(--sr-panel);border:1px solid var(--sr-line);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden}.sr-board-wrap{padding:26px;border-right:1px solid var(--sr-line)}.sr-board-top h2{font-size:16px;margin:0}.sr-board-top>span{font:10px monospace;color:var(--sr-dim)}.sr-meters{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:22px 0 18px}.sr-meters div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.sr-meters small{font:9px monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--sr-dim)}.sr-meters strong{font-size:24px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.sr-meters div:nth-child(2) strong{color:var(--sr-lime)}.sr-board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px;aspect-ratio:1;touch-action:none;background:#111528;border-radius:12px;padding:8px}.sr-board .sr-cell{min-height:0;min-width:0;aspect-ratio:1;padding:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:700 clamp(14px,3.4vw,29px)/1 Arial;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #313952;background:#232b42;position:relative}.sr-cell[data-kind=wall]{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#333c52,#333c52 3px,#293147 3px,#293147 7px);border-color:#3b4359}.sr-cell[data-kind=shard]{color:var(--sr-lime);background:#293831}.sr-cell[data-kind=exit]{color:var(--sr-violet);border-color:var(--sr-violet)}.sr-cell[data-kind=player]{background:var(--sr-lime);color:#1c2a20;border-color:#efffc2;box-shadow:0 0 20px #dcff7925}.sr-cell[data-visited=yes]:not([data-kind=wall]):not([data-kind=player]):not([data-kind=shard]):not([data-kind=exit])::after{content:'';width:6px;height:6px;background:#6c7499;border-radius:50%}.sr-cell[data-suggested=yes]{outline:3px solid var(--sr-violet);outline-offset:-3px}.sr-legend{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--sr-dim);margin-top:16px}.sr-dot{margin-right:4px}.sr-dot-player,.sr-dot-shard{color:var(--sr-lime)}.sr-dot-exit{color:var(--sr-violet)}.sr-console{padding:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.sr-console h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px}.sr-console>p:not(.sr-kicker){font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--sr-dim)}.sr-console .sr-help{font-size:12px!important}.sr-dpad{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,50px);grid-template-rows:repeat(3,46px);gap:6px;margin:10px auto}.sr-dpad button{font-size:24px;padding:0}.sr-dpad [data-dir=U]{grid-area:1/2}.sr-dpad [data-dir=L]{grid-area:2/1}.sr-dpad span{grid-area:2/2;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--sr-lime)}.sr-dpad [data-dir=R]{grid-area:2/3}.sr-dpad [data-dir=D]{grid-area:3/2}.sr-console .sr-live{color:var(--sr-text)!important;background:#101427;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;width:100%;min-height:68px}.sr-game-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}.sr-fine{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.65;color:var(--sr-dim)!important}.sr-passport,.sr-chain{padding:42px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sr-line)}.sr-section-head h2{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0}.sr-section-head .sr-kicker{margin-bottom:8px}.sr-section-head>span{font:11px monospace;color:var(--sr-dim)}.sr-passport>p,.sr-chain>p{max-width:780px;line-height:1.7;font-size:15px;color:var(--sr-dim)}.sr-stamps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(195px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:24px 0}.sr-stamp{padding:20px;border:1px dashed #77845d;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#28332c,#192031);color:var(--sr-lime);min-height:230px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.sr-stamp-symbol{font-size:68px;line-height:1.2;align-self:center}.sr-stamp small{font:9px/1.6 monospace;letter-spacing:.12em}.sr-stamp h3{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:14px 0 5px}.sr-stamp p{font-size:11px;color:var(--sr-dim)}.sr-stamp button{margin-top:auto;width:100%;font-size:11px}.sr-stamp-empty{border-color:var(--sr-line);background:transparent;color:var(--sr-dim);justify-content:center;text-align:center;align-items:center}.sr-wallet{padding:20px;background:var(--sr-panel);border-radius:12px}.sr-wallet>summary{font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.signal-run .ca-key{color:var(--sr-text);background:#111528;border-color:var(--sr-line);margin:18px 0}.signal-run .ca-key h3,.signal-run .ca-key .ca-status{color:var(--sr-text)}.signal-run .ca-key p,.signal-run .ca-key .ca-hint{color:var(--sr-dim)}.signal-run .ca-key .btn{font-size:12px}.signal-run .ca-input{background:#252b45;color:var(--sr-text);border-color:var(--sr-line)}.sr-review,.sr-receipt{border:1px solid var(--sr-violet);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin-top:16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.sr-review pre,.sr-review code,.sr-receipt code{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:11px/1.8 monospace;color:var(--sr-dim)}.sr-review pre{padding:14px;background:#191e35;border-radius:8px;max-height:350px;overflow:auto}.sr-review p,.sr-receipt p{margin:12px 0}.sr-footer{padding:24px 0;font:10px/1.7 monospace;color:var(--sr-dim);flex-wrap:wrap}.sr-footer a{text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:720px){.signal-run{padding:16px 16px 100px}.sr-nav>span{display:none}.sr-hero{padding:35px 0 28px;display:block}.sr-hero h1{font-size:clamp(52px,15vw,88px)}.sr-event{border-left:0;padding:0;margin-top:24px;gap:6px}.sr-event strong{font-size:18px}.sr-event small{font-size:10px}.sr-event .sr-pill{margin-top:7px}.sr-play{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sr-board-wrap{padding:18px;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sr-line)}.sr-console{padding:22px}.sr-console h2{font-size:26px}.sr-dpad{margin:14px auto}.sr-section-head{align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.sr-section-head h2{font-size:27px}.sr-stamps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.sr-stamp{padding:14px;min-height:220px}.sr-stamp h3{font-size:17px}.sr-stamp-symbol{font-size:54px}.sr-cell{font-size:24px!important}.sr-hero h1 i{margin-left:12px}.sr-meters{margin:18px 0 14px}}
</style>
